---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Link from "@components/Link.astro";
import collageNic from "@assets/collage-nicaragua.png";
---

<section
  class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 bg-linear-to-r from-text-blue to-text-blue-light px-8 py-24 text-bg-primary md:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center lg:px-16"
  aria-labelledby="home-title"
>
  <div>
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold lg:text-4xl">Descubre Nicaragua</h1>

    <p class="mb-8">
      La tierra de los lagos y los volcanes te espera. Un país rico en historia,
      cultura y playas paradisíacas, con una gastronomía que te hará enamorarte.
    </p>

    <Link
      url="/nica-page/tourism"
      label="Explora destinos ->"
      className="max-w-2xs rounded-md bg-bg-primary py-2 font-bold text-text-primary hover:bg-text-success hover:text-bg-primary"
    />

    <Link
      url="#discover"
      label="Saber más ->"
      className="mt-4 max-w-2xs rounded-md border border-bg-primary py-2 font-bold text-bg-primary hover:border-transparent  hover:bg-text-success hover:text-bg-primary"
    />
  </div>

  <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-md md:max-w-xl">
    <Picture
      alt="collage de imágenes de Nicaragua"
      src={collageNic}
      formats={["avif", "webp"]}
      priority
    />
  </figure>
</section>
